OL,3,CSick hedgehog 'hands himself in' at
OL,4,Cambulance station
OL,6,FAmbulances are usually sent out to
OL,7,Ftreat and transport sick people but in
OL,8,FGuernsey, a poorly hedgehog reportedly
OL,9,Fturned up at the medics' door needing
OL,10,Fhelp.
OL,12,FThe animal is now receiving treatment
OL,13,Ffrom a local charity after
OL,14,F"effectively handing himself in" at St
OL,15,FJohn Ambulance Station in St Peter
OL,16,FPort.
OL,18,FNicknamed 'Snotty', the hedgehog is
OL,19,Fbeing looked after in the GSPCA's
OL,20,FIntensive Care Unit.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/3
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
