PN,35402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785534490
OL,3,CSick hedgehog 'hands himself in' at
OL,4,Cambulance station
OL,6,FHe has had several ticks removed and
OL,7,Fis now being monitored.
OL,9,FSteve Byrne, GSPCA Manager, says: "We
OL,10,Fare incredibly grateful to the St John
OL,11,Fteam for spotting that Snotty needed
OL,12,Fhelp and bringing him to us so quickly.
OL,14,F"He was not in the best of condition
OL,15,Fwhen he arrived and required treatment.
OL,17,F"Cases like this are a reminder of
OL,18,Fjust how important it is for people to
OL,19,Fact quickly when they see wildlife in
OL,20,Fdifficulty."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/3
