CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1785534490
OL,3,CSick hedgehog 'hands himself in' at
OL,4,Cambulance station
OL,6,FThe charity adds that hedgehogs are
OL,7,Fone of the most common animals it sees
OL,8,Fin need of help.
OL,10,FIf anyone spots an injured or sick
OL,11,Fanimal in Guernsey, they are asked to
OL,12,Fcontact the GSPCA on 01481 257261.
